# The build context holds only what the image needs (Dockerfile); everything
# else (tests, deploy scripts, docs, local models, git data) stays out.
*
!*.py
!requirements.lock
!scripts/download_models.py
!databases/data_en.csv
!static/
!templates/
!LICENSE
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
